    "{\"block\": \"## Example 2b: Science MCQ you're unsure about \\u2192 search or escalate\", \"description\": \"Remove redundant third science-MCQ exemplar (overlaps Example 2 and 2c) to cut instruction-token bloat in the front-door few-shot block. Single-variable: deletes one exemplar, no logic change. Auto-gate accepts only if T1 quality >= 1.814 baseline AND instruction_token_ratio decreases; otherwise it reverts and we learn the exemplar is load-bearing for gpqa-class MCQ routing.\", \"file\": \"rules.md\", \"type\": \"structural_prune\"}": 1,
