    "{\"description\": \"Audit and minimally fix escalation decision/fallback handling for debugbench and coder-style tasks so failed, low-confidence, empty, or truncated specialist outputs escalate to coder_escalation or architect_general instead of being accepted. Single variable: escalation fallback correctness only; do not change prompts, scoring, question pools, model registry, routing thresholds unrelated to fallback validity, or eval methodology.\", \"file\": \"src/escalation.py\", \"mutation\": \"targeted_fix\", \"type\": \"code_mutation\"}": 1,
