    "{\"description\": \"Evolutionary frontdoor-prompt optimization targeting the weak/improving suites (tool_use 0.00\\u21920.60, gpqa, mode_advantage) without regressing the 3.00-saturated suites \\u2014 rotating off the numeric streak per the stagnation protocol onto the steered prompt surface.\", \"file\": \"frontdoor.md\", \"max_evals\": 50, \"type\": \"gepa_optimize\"}": 1,
    "{\"description\": \"Evolutionary optimization of the tool-use instructions for multi-step agentic tasks: search prompt variants that raise correct tool selection + argument construction + result chaining + stop-decision on the agentic suite, without regressing the already-3.0 tool_use/coder/livecodebench suites or inflating tokens. Build on the #784 targeted_fix (kept) \\u2014 population search where the single edit was neutral. Reward = downstream agentic/tool quality, penalize length bloat.\", \"file\": \"tools.md\", \"max_evals\": 50, \"type\": \"gepa_optimize\"}": 1,
    "{\"description\": \"Evolutionary-optimize the formalizer prompt to strengthen verbatim output-format/schema enforcement (exact JSON/list/field-order/casing) for the floored instruction_precision suite, without lengthening non-format prose. GEPA searches candidate phrasings rather than betting on a single hand-edit (cf. t779 manual targeted_fix q=1.74 that did not break the floor). Single-variable: only formalizer.md changes; eval tower, question pool, and scoring untouched.\", \"file\": \"formalizer.md\", \"max_evals\": 50, \"type\": \"gepa_optimize\"}": 1,
    "{\"description\": \"Evolve the architect investigation prompt to lift hard-reasoning/science accuracy (gpqa stuck at 0.69, the suite repeatedly gating T2 deep_eval), without lengthening non-reasoning paths. Hypothesis: architect_investigate under-specifies stepwise evidence-gathering and answer-commitment for graduate-level reasoning; GEPA's evolved candidate should move gpqa off its floor while the safety gate guards thinking/coder/debugbench against regression.\", \"file\": \"architect_investigate.md\", \"max_evals\": 50, \"type\": \"gepa_optimize\"}": 1,
    "{\"description\": \"Evolve the root reasoning/CALL-governing system prompt to recover the qwen3.6 thinking/agentic weakness and reduce zero-tool-call latency, via prompt evolution only (not tool_policy). Break the structural_experiment stagnation on an under-used, previously critic-approved surface; accept the evolved candidate only if it is non-inferior to baseline 1.814 with no thinking/agentic/tool_use suite regression.\", \"file\": \"root_lm_system.md\", \"max_evals\": 50, \"type\": \"gepa_optimize\"}": 1,
